members.member:
Gets or sets a header of a table.
A object representing the header of the table.
/// The table must include at least one of the following: Details, Header, or Footer.

Gets or sets a footer of a table.
A object representing the footer of the table.
/// The table must include at least one of the following: Details, Header, or Footer.

